  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation PRO-JUST: strengthening the criminal Justice chain in PALOP-TL countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Action aims at contribution to peace and justice trough the promotion of stronger institutions and the rule of law. Emphasis will be placed on the reduction of corruption, money laundering, and organized crime with a focus on dru trafficking, through prevention, investigation, and criminalization to improve accountability and compliance with good governance principles. The Action builds upon the results obtained with the programme PACED and will include new components (digitalization) and involve other actors (media and Civil society) and adopt a new strategy priming for the materialization of the knowledge gathered in the past decade. The intervention will focus on i) drafting legislation, strategies and plans on corruption, money laundering and organized cirme; ii) improving skills of key state and non state actors involved in the fight against corruption, ml and organized crime; iii) operationalize strategic means (including digital) for the criminal justice actors and strengthen their mandate.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
